      "v": 7,
      "zh": "亚兰王灭绝约哈斯的民，践踏他们如禾场上的尘沙，只给约哈斯留下五十马兵，十辆战车，一万步兵。",
      "en": "Jehoahaz had no army left[NOTE:1] except for 50 horsemen, 10 chariots, and 10,000 foot soldiers. The king of Syria had destroyed his troops[NOTE:2] and trampled on them as dust.[NOTE:3]",
